  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 103.01 Federal classification method",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 103.01 “Federal classification method” means the method in “Classification of Wetlands and Deepwater Habitats of the United States”, adapted from Cowardin, Carter, Golet and LaRoe (1979), Wetlands Subcommittee, Federal Geographic Data Committee, August 2013, FGDC-STD-004-2013, available as noted in Appendix B.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1, #2, #3, and #4 at Chapter heading for Env-Wt 100) #12801, eff 12-15-19",
